&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppLovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.applovin.com&amp;amp;esheet=54549558&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260608414458&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AppLovin&amp;amp;index=3&amp;amp;md5=a4ac8b1dcb8b5502d0154df68e322df6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AppLovin&lt;/a&gt; makes technologies that help businesses of every size connect to their ideal customers. The company provides end-to-end advertising solutions for businesses to reach, monetize and grow their global audiences. For more information about AppLovin, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.applovin.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To deliver on this mission, our global team is composed of team members with life experiences, backgrounds, and perspectives that mirror our developers and customers around the world. At AppLovin, we are intentional about the team and culture we are building, seeking candidates who are outstanding in their own right and also demonstrate their support of others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a smart, hardworking Business Operations Analyst to provide technical and operational support to our Business Operations (BizOps) team and the systems supporting our mobile-advertising business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A central part of this role is helping other BizOps analysts deliver reliable projects. You will review their code, debug existing workflows, investigate product issues, and translate business problems into actionable requests for Engineering and Operations. You will also write and maintain your own workflow code and analyze product features and experiments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as a practical link between business and technical teams. We’re looking for someone who learns quickly, investigates problems independently, exercises good judgment, and follows issues through to resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted development is a regular part of how our team works. You should be effective at using these tools and reviewing the code they produce, with the technical understanding to identify mistakes, challenge assumptions, and guide work toward reliable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support projects led by other BizOps analysts, helping clarify requirements, review technical approaches, and resolve implementation problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug issues in existing workflow code, integrations, and data processes. Investigate root causes and implement or coordinate fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review BizOps pull requests, including substantial AI-generated changes, for correctness, security, maintainability, and alignment with business requirements. Provide actionable feedback and verify that concerns are addressed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain Python code, SQL workflows, integrations, and automations supporting the team’s work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate product bugs, distinguish expected behavior from defects, and gather evidence through code, logs, data, and reproducible examples.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear tickets for Engineering and Operations that explain the problem, business impact, supporting evidence, and expected outcome. Follow up on dependencies and verify resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Google Cloud Platform (GCP) services supporting BizOps workflows, including service accounts, permissions, secrets, configuration, and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Salesforce workflows and integrations, including programming against its application programming interfaces (APIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze product features, experiments, and operational and advertising data. Apply appropriate statistical methods, interpret results accurately, and explain limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate discrepancies across internal systems and partner platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize competing requests and communicate findings, decisions, blockers, and next steps through concise Slack messages, tickets, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least two years of relevant professional experience in business operations, technical operations, analytics, software development, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical ability through a bachelor’s degree in a field such as engineering, statistics, mathematics, computer science, or physics, or through substantial technical work, research, or projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and demonstrated ability to learn unfamiliar systems, connect information across sources, and work through ambiguous problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong work ethic and sense of ownership: you take initiative, persist through difficult problems, and follow work through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment about data quality, system changes, permissions, and operational risk. You recognize which problems you can resolve independently and when additional expertise or review is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective use of AI coding and workflow tools to develop, review, and maintain substantial volumes of code. You can evaluate generated work, identify mistakes, and steer it toward the intended outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with Python, SQL, Git, pull-request workflows, and APIs, including investigating and debugging existing code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience managing GCP services and workflows, including permissions, credentials, configuration, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying statistical analysis and data science techniques, including selecting appropriate methods, interpreting results accurately, and explaining limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in advertising technology, with a working understanding of areas such as campaign delivery, attribution, measurement, mediation, monetization, or the iOS and Android ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise written communication. You can explain technical issues in business terms, document reproducible problems, and write requirements and tickets that others can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting internal tools, reviewing other people’s code, or coordinating technical work across business, Engineering, and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce administration, reporting, permission models, or integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining production automations, data pipelines, or shared internal applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with least-privilege access and sensitive data handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BizOps analysts can rely on you to investigate technical problems, review their work thoughtfully, and help their projects move forward. Engineering and Operations receive clear, actionable requests supported by useful evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You resolve workflow issues, maintain reliable code, and deliver sound product analysis. Over time, you identify recurring problems and improve the tools, documentation, and practices that help the broader BizOps team work effectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;AppLovin provides a competitive total compensation package with a pay for performance rewards approach. Total compensation at AppLovin is based on a number of factors including market location and may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Depending on the position offered, equity, and other forms of incentive compensation (as applicable) may be provided as part of a total compensation package, in addition to dental, vision, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
