&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppLovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.applovin.com&amp;amp;esheet=54549558&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260608414458&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AppLovin&amp;amp;index=3&amp;amp;md5=a4ac8b1dcb8b5502d0154df68e322df6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AppLovin&lt;/a&gt; makes technologies that help businesses of every size connect to their ideal customers. The company provides end-to-end advertising solutions for businesses to reach, monetize and grow their global audiences. For more information about AppLovin, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.applovin.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To deliver on this mission, our global team is composed of team members with life experiences, backgrounds, and perspectives that mirror our developers and customers around the world. At AppLovin, we are intentional about the team and culture we are building, seeking candidates who are outstanding in their own right and also demonstrate their support of others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gist is a new consumer social app built by AppLovin, a handbook for the curious. We’re looking for a Full Stack Engineer to build the web applications, embedded web experiences, and mini games that bring our product to life.&lt;br&gt;You’ll work across frontend interfaces and backend services, turning product ideas into experiences that are fast, reliable, and easy to use. Your work will span responsive web pages, experiences embedded in mobile apps through WebViews, and lightweight interactive games.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll own features from implementation through launch, contribute to larger projects with guidance from experienced engineers, and work closely with product and design to improve what we ship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A Day in the Life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain responsive web applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript or TypeScript, and a modern frontend framework.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Develop web experiences that work smoothly inside mobile WebViews, accounting for different screen sizes, devices, and platform behavior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Build and integrate lightweight mini games and interactive features, including the interfaces and backend services that support them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain backend APIs and database integrations that power product features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Partner with product managers, designers, and mobile engineers to turn requirements into working features and deliver them through release.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Improve overall product performance, stability, and user experience across all platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Write maintainable, tested code, participate in code reviews, and troubleshoot issues across the frontend and backend.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Impact You’ll Make&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Help shape how users discover, interact with, and enjoy Gist across web and mobile experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Turn new product ideas into working features and improve them through user feedback and product data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Contribute reusable components and integrations that help the team deliver future experiences faster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Help establish a reliable technical foundation as the product grows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who You Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Two years of professional software engineering experience, with practical experience contributing to both frontend and backend development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Strong foundations in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript or TypeScript, including responsive layouts and browser behavior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience with a modern frontend framework such as React or Vue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience building backend services in at least one programming language, working with APIs, and using relational or non-relational databases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience delivering smaller features independently and contributing to larger projects with guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;A thoughtful approach to debugging, testing, and writing code that others can understand and maintain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Comfortable collaborating across engineering, product, and design, asking questions early, and following through on delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Care about the details that make consumer products feel intuitive and responsive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience building cross-platform web applications, mini apps, or embedded web experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with mobile WebViews, communication between web content and native apps, or platform SDK integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience building HTML5 games or interactive browser experiences using Canvas, WebGL, or a game framework.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with product analytics, feature experiments, or consumer applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;Experience using AI coding tools such as Claude Code or Cursor, with careful review and validation of generated code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;AppLovin is proud to be an equal opportunity employer that is committed to inclusion and diversity. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status, or other legally protected characteristics. Learn more about EEO rights as an applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/employers/eeo-law-poster&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please send us a request at &lt;strong&gt;jobs@applovin.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;AppLovin will consider for employment all qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with applicable law.&amp;nbsp; If you’re applying for a position in California, learn more&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://calcivilrights.ca.gov/fair-chance-act/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To support an efficient and fair hiring process, we may use technology-assisted tools, including artificial intelligence (AI), to help identify and evaluate candidates. All hiring decisions are ultimately made by human reviewers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Please read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://legal.applovin.com/global-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about how AppLovin processes your personal information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-follow-us.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Follow Us&quot; width=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/applovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-linkedin.svg&quot; alt=&quot;LinkedIn icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/AppLovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-x.svg&quot; alt=&quot;X icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/applovin/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-instagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Instagram icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppLovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.applovin.com&amp;amp;esheet=54549558&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260608414458&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AppLovin&amp;amp;index=3&amp;amp;md5=a4ac8b1dcb8b5502d0154df68e322df6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AppLovin&lt;/a&gt; makes technologies that help businesses of every size connect to their ideal customers. The company provides end-to-end advertising solutions for businesses to reach, monetize and grow their global audiences. For more information about AppLovin, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.applovin.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To deliver on this mission, our global team is composed of team members with life experiences, backgrounds, and perspectives that mirror our developers and customers around the world. At AppLovin, we are intentional about the team and culture we are building, seeking candidates who are outstanding in their own right and also demonstrate their support of others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AppLovin is seeking an International Tax Manager to support our growing global tax function. The tax team is a highly collaborative, high-impact group. This role is ideal for someone who thrives on ownership and enjoys partnering across finance and accounting teams. You&#39;ll play a visible, hands-on role in global tax provision and compliance matters, tax planning and strategy and supporting the use of technology to improve efficiency and accuracy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time role that can be held remotely within the U.S.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For tax provision and compliance, prepare U.S. international tax workpapers including but not limited to GILTI, FDII, FTC, and BEAT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on foreign tax provision and Pillar 2 workpapers, and help coordinate Pillar 2 compliance with our external providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage the global tax compliance process, including review of foreign statutory financials and foreign income tax returns alongside our external providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support international tax planning projects, including building tax models for cross-border transactions, entity structuring, and new business initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across tax, accounting, finance, and other business stakeholders to gather and analyze information required to ensure accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor U.S. and foreign tax legislative developments and communicate potential impacts and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tax technology and data tools to automate and streamline tax processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ad hoc projects and special assignments as needed, including tax audit notices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a strong fit if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, or related field; CPA or MST preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of corporate tax experience with significant focus on U.S. international tax compliance and provision or federal tax matters with international exposure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Excel and Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with NetSuite or other ERP systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in working in a fast-paced, high-growth technology or multinational&amp;nbsp;environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Attributes &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented and analytical: brings care, accuracy and good judgment to complex tax calculations and analyses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership-minded: takes initiative, follows through, and asks thoughtful questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative: works well across teams and pitches in when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to have handled every area listed above, but this role is best suited for candidates with either direct U.S. international tax experience or strong federal tax experience with meaningful international tax exposure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;AppLovin provides a competitive total compensation package with a pay for performance rewards approach. Total compensation at AppLovin is based on a number of factors including market location and may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Depending on the position offered, equity, and other forms of incentive compensation (as applicable) may be provided as part of a total compensation package, in addition to dental, vision, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health Insurance:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Medical, Dental, Vision, Life, Disability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; 401(k) Retirement Plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlimited Discretionary Time Off&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Holidays:&lt;/strong&gt; 10 paid holidays per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Sick Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; 80 hours per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method of Application:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply online&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window:&lt;/strong&gt; The application window is expected to close within 30 days of the posting date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All questions or concerns about this posting should be directed to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:peopleops@applovin.com&quot;&gt;peopleops@applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CA Base Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$173,560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$198,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;AppLovin is proud to be an equal opportunity employer that is committed to inclusion and diversity. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status, or other legally protected characteristics. Learn more about EEO rights as an applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/employers/eeo-law-poster&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please send us a request at &lt;strong&gt;jobs@applovin.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;AppLovin will consider for employment all qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with applicable law.&amp;nbsp; If you’re applying for a position in California, learn more&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://calcivilrights.ca.gov/fair-chance-act/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To support an efficient and fair hiring process, we may use technology-assisted tools, including artificial intelligence (AI), to help identify and evaluate candidates. All hiring decisions are ultimately made by human reviewers.&lt;/div&gt;
