&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppLovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.applovin.com&amp;amp;esheet=54549558&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260608414458&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AppLovin&amp;amp;index=3&amp;amp;md5=a4ac8b1dcb8b5502d0154df68e322df6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AppLovin&lt;/a&gt; makes technologies that help businesses of every size connect to their ideal customers. The company provides end-to-end advertising solutions for businesses to reach, monetize and grow their global audiences. For more information about AppLovin, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.applovin.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To deliver on this mission, our global team is composed of team members with life experiences, backgrounds, and perspectives that mirror our developers and customers around the world. At AppLovin, we are intentional about the team and culture we are building, seeking candidates who are outstanding in their own right and also demonstrate their support of others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About the Role&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re building a next-generation global content platform that helps people turn real-life experiences into valuable stories for others. We’re a small, high-caliber founding team, backed by AppLovin’s technology, data capabilities, and global reach.&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for a Product Manager in Palo Alto to be the voice of the user. You’ll own how we learn about our users and the US market, then turn what you learn into product decisions. Most of your time will go to talking with users, studying the market, and digging through feedback, and you’ll translate all of it into clear insights that shape our roadmap.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;A Day in the Life&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Independently plan and run user research: recruit participants, conduct interviews, and synthesize findings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Run market and competitive research on our features and product, including spending real time in other apps to understand what works and why&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Turn feedback from support tickets, Apple App Store and Google Play reviews, and community channels into structured product insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Dig into why users return, stay active, or drop off, and recommend specific actions to improve retention and engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Identify what motivates the users to share, engage, and come back, and propose distinctive, culturally resonant features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Engineering and Operations to turn insights into roadmap priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Present findings and recommendations clearly to the team and leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Impact You’ll Make&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Be the user voice:&lt;/b&gt; Bring a real understanding of culture and behavior into every product decision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Turn feedback into direction:&lt;/b&gt; Build a repeatable system that converts raw feedback into prioritized insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shape what we build:&lt;/b&gt; Your research will directly influence which features we build, change, or cut.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Drive retention and engagement:&lt;/b&gt; Combine qualitative insight with usage data to improve returning and active users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Who You Are&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;3-6 years of experience in product management, product marketing, strategy and operations, consulting, user research, or a similar analytical role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;A startup background and mindset: you’ve worked in early-stage or fast-growing teams, taken on a much bigger scope than your title suggested, and moved things forward without waiting to be told what to do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Strong initiative and ownership: you spot problems and opportunities on your own and drive them to a result&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Strong sense for the culture, trends, and how people use social and content apps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Warm and approachable, with the ability to put people at ease and draw out honest, thoughtful answers in interviews&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Strong product sense: you’re curious about apps, have opinions about what makes them good or bad, and enjoy picking products apart&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;A structured thinker who can synthesize messy qualitative input into clear, actionable conclusions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Comfortable with data, and able to pair qualitative findings with usage metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and a fast-moving environment&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Experience in consumer, social, community, or content products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;A background in consulting, market research, or user research&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Experience analyzing app store reviews or support data at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Interest in a long-term career in product management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why Join&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Join at the founding stage of a global consumer product, with direct visibility and impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Take on a broad scope early, with the autonomy to own problems end to end and see your work shape the product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Work in a small, collaborative team where ideas are debated openly and ownership is real&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Get the backing of AppLovin’s scale, technology, and resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;AppLovin is proud to be an equal opportunity employer that is committed to inclusion and diversity. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status, or other legally protected characteristics. Learn more about EEO rights as an applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/employers/eeo-law-poster&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please send us a request at &lt;strong&gt;jobs@applovin.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;AppLovin will consider for employment all qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with applicable law.&amp;nbsp; If you’re applying for a position in California, learn more&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://calcivilrights.ca.gov/fair-chance-act/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To support an efficient and fair hiring process, we may use technology-assisted tools, including artificial intelligence (AI), to help identify and evaluate candidates. All hiring decisions are ultimately made by human reviewers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Please read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://legal.applovin.com/global-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about how AppLovin processes your personal information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-follow-us.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Follow Us&quot; width=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/applovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-linkedin.svg&quot; alt=&quot;LinkedIn icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/AppLovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-x.svg&quot; alt=&quot;X icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/applovin/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-instagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Instagram icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppLovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.applovin.com&amp;amp;esheet=54549558&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260608414458&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AppLovin&amp;amp;index=3&amp;amp;md5=a4ac8b1dcb8b5502d0154df68e322df6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AppLovin&lt;/a&gt; makes technologies that help businesses of every size connect to their ideal customers. The company provides end-to-end advertising solutions for businesses to reach, monetize and grow their global audiences. For more information about AppLovin, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.applovin.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To deliver on this mission, our global team is composed of team members with life experiences, backgrounds, and perspectives that mirror our developers and customers around the world. At AppLovin, we are intentional about the team and culture we are building, seeking candidates who are outstanding in their own right and also demonstrate their support of others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Gist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gist is a new consumer social app built by AppLovin — a handbook for the curious. We&#39;re building our creative engine from the ground up, and we&#39;re looking for a Creative Strategist who lives at the intersection of storytelling and performance data.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own the creative strategy behind our paid social advertising. You&#39;ll concept, brief, and iterate on ads that are genuinely enriching, while staying deeply connected to the metrics that determine what scales.&lt;br&gt;Central to this is your ability to identify, brief, and collaborate with top creators to produce authentic content that resonates at scale.&lt;br&gt;This is a hands-on seat. You&#39;re not handing briefs to an agency and reviewing decks. You&#39;re in the work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are launching a new social platform dedicated to the relatable, actionable content that people use to navigate their daily lives.&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Senior Creator Partnerships Manager to be the connective tissue between our platform and the macro and mega influencer talent that will define it.&lt;br&gt;This is a dealmaker role, we want someone who knows the influencer landscape cold, has relationships with talent management companies, and can negotiate custom agreements that make top creators want to build on a new platform.&lt;br&gt;You will own a budget, set recruitment strategy, and be the reason our best creators show up.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Day in the Life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
