&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit macro and mega/celebrity influencers across US lifestyle verticals to post on our platform and amplify their content elsewhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own creator partnership strategy — identifying the right talent mix, negotiating custom deals, and managing relationships with influencers and their management companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimize a creator recruitment budget, balancing deal value against platform growth and content quality goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a strong pipeline of creator talent through your existing network and proactive outreach across agencies, management firms, and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global cross-functional teams to structure deals and ensure smooth creator onboarding and activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on creator performance, partnership ROI, and content impact to inform ongoing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the creator roster that shapes our platform&#39;s identity and drives daily active use from launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish Gist&#39;s credibility in the influencer ecosystem — becoming the go-to contact for talent looking to expand to new platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable partnership frameworks and deal structures that can grow with the platform across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly influence product direction with ground-level insight into what creators need to succeed on a feed-based platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in influencer partnerships, creator talent, or influencer marketing — ideally at an agency that works with brands and manages or brokers relationships with large-scale talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record working with macro (500K–1M followers) and mega/celebrity (1M+) influencers across lifestyle, beauty, wellness, food, or adjacent verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong existing Rolodex — relationships with talent managers, MCNs, and agency contacts that you can activate quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in custom deal negotiation: you know market rates, deal structures, exclusivity windows, and how to get to yes without overpaying.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with a creator recruitment budget and being accountable for the ROI it generates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or inside a global organization while owning a domestic US remit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who can represent Gist credibly in rooms with top-tier talent and their representatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with influencers in the 500K–5M follower range who are open to emerging platform opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a platform (TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, Snapchat, or similar) in a partnerships or creator growth capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with lifestyle feed content dynamics — what drives daily engagement, retention, and shareability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join This Venture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is more than a partnerships role — it&#39;s a chance to define the creator ecosystem of a new global product inside an industry leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy the autonomy and deal-making latitude of a startup, backed by AppLovin&#39;s resources, technology, and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a lean, fast-moving team that values relationships, speed, and creative thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High visibility into how creator strategy drives product growth — with a direct line to leadership from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
