&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-follow-us.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Follow Us&quot; width=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/applovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-linkedin.svg&quot; alt=&quot;LinkedIn icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/AppLovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-x.svg&quot; alt=&quot;X icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/applovin/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-instagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Instagram icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppLovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.applovin.com&amp;amp;esheet=54549558&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260608414458&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AppLovin&amp;amp;index=3&amp;amp;md5=a4ac8b1dcb8b5502d0154df68e322df6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AppLovin&lt;/a&gt; makes technologies that help businesses of every size connect to their ideal customers. The company provides end-to-end advertising solutions for businesses to reach, monetize and grow their global audiences. For more information about AppLovin, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.applovin.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To deliver on this mission, our global team is composed of team members with life experiences, backgrounds, and perspectives that mirror our developers and customers around the world. At AppLovin, we are intentional about the team and culture we are building, seeking candidates who are outstanding in their own right and also demonstrate their support of others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;AppLovin is seeking a Talent Acquisition &amp;amp; Culture Leader to shape how we attract, engage, and retain talent across our global Engineering organization. Reporting directly to the CTO, you will lead a small global team spanning recruiting, talent operations, and events. You will oversee technical recruiting, university programs, campus employer branding, talent development, and employee engagement, while partnering with the branding team to contribute to AppLovin’s broader employer brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity for a hands-on talent leader to work directly within Engineering and help shape both the teams we build and the experience of being part of them. Culture is central to this role: how people connect, collaborate, and feel supported matters to their well-being and their ability to do exceptional work. In partnership with Engineering and HR leaders, you will bring that commitment to life through programs and experiences that support employee well-being, strengthen belonging, and build meaningful connections across our global teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine this focus on people and culture with deep technical recruiting expertise and sound business judgment, setting strategic priorities, developing your team, and personally leading select senior, business-critical, and hard-to-fill searches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and drive the global technical recruiting strategy, aligning hiring priorities, university programs, and recruiting events with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a global team of recruiters, program managers, and events professionals, establishing clear priorities and accountability while personally driving select high-priority searches from sourcing through close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the CTO and Engineering leaders as a trusted talent advisor, translating business strategy into actionable hiring plans and anticipating future talent needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale global university recruiting programs, deepening university partnerships and creating strong pathways from internships to full-time careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to AppLovin’s overall employer branding efforts, partnering with the branding team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead our campus employer branding strategy through events and targeted campaigns that strengthen our university presence and connect with emerging talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of recruiting experience, including at least 5 years managing people, with demonstrated success leading technical recruiting in a fast-moving, high-performing organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build, coach, and develop global talent teams spanning recruiting, programs, and events, with clear expectations and accountability for results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of personally attracting, assessing, and closing highly sought-after technical talent, including senior candidates and hires for hard-to-fill roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on leadership approach that combines strategic thinking with disciplined execution and the ability to balance team leadership with direct recruiting ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising senior Engineering leaders across geographies, with the credibility to influence decisions, align stakeholders, and navigate competing priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling university recruiting, internship, and new-graduate programs that create lasting talent pipelines is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and analytical judgment, with the ability to challenge assumptions, anticipate talent needs, and connect recruiting priorities to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment and discretion in sensitive people matters, with the ability to recognize concerns and engage the appropriate HR or legal partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;AppLovin provides a competitive total compensation package with a pay for performance rewards approach. Total compensation at AppLovin is based on a number of factors including market location and may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Depending on the position offered, equity, and other forms of incentive compensation (as applicable) may be provided as part of a total compensation package, in addition to dental, vision, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Types of Pay:&lt;/strong&gt; Equity eligible&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Medical, Dental, Vision, Life, Disability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; 401(k) Retirement Plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlimited Discretionary Time Off&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Holidays:&lt;/strong&gt; 10 paid holidays per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Sick Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; 80 hours per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method of Application:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply online&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window:&lt;/strong&gt; The application window is expected to close within 30 days of the posting date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All questions or concerns about this posting should be directed to peopleops@applovin.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CA Base Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$330,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;AppLovin is proud to be an equal opportunity employer that is committed to inclusion and diversity. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status, or other legally protected characteristics. Learn more about EEO rights as an applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/employers/eeo-law-poster&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please send us a request at &lt;strong&gt;jobs@applovin.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;AppLovin will consider for employment all qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with applicable law.&amp;nbsp; If you’re applying for a position in California, learn more&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://calcivilrights.ca.gov/fair-chance-act/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To support an efficient and fair hiring process, we may use technology-assisted tools, including artificial intelligence (AI), to help identify and evaluate candidates. All hiring decisions are ultimately made by human reviewers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Please read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://legal.applovin.com/global-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about how AppLovin processes your personal information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-follow-us.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Follow Us&quot; width=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/applovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-linkedin.svg&quot; alt=&quot;LinkedIn icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/AppLovin&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-x.svg&quot; alt=&quot;X icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/applovin/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/applovin_assets_us/svg/greenhouse-icon-instagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;Instagram icon&quot; width=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AppLovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.applovin.com&amp;amp;esheet=54549558&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260608414458&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AppLovin&amp;amp;index=3&amp;amp;md5=a4ac8b1dcb8b5502d0154df68e322df6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AppLovin&lt;/a&gt; makes technologies that help businesses of every size connect to their ideal customers. The company provides end-to-end advertising solutions for businesses to reach, monetize and grow their global audiences. For more information about AppLovin, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.applovin.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.applovin.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To deliver on this mission, our global team is composed of team members with life experiences, backgrounds, and perspectives that mirror our developers and customers around the world. At AppLovin, we are intentional about the team and culture we are building, seeking candidates who are outstanding in their own right and also demonstrate their support of others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About Gist&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gist is a new consumer social app built by AppLovin, a handbook for the curious. We’re building our brand and community from the ground up, and we’re looking for a Social Media Manager who is as comfortable creating content as they are reading the data behind it.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you’ll own Gist’s voice and presence across social. You’ll create, test, and iterate on content that is genuinely useful and worth sharing, and you’ll stay close to the metrics that tell you what’s working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;About the Role&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are launching a new social platform dedicated to the relatable, actionable content that people use to navigate their daily lives.&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Social Media Manager to be the face and voice of Gist across the platforms where our audience already lives: Instagram, TikTok, Threads, Substack, and whatever comes next.&lt;br&gt;This is a builder role. We want someone who has grown an audience from zero, knows what makes content travel on each platform, and move faster than anyone around them.&lt;br&gt;You will own our social channels end to end and be the reason people discover Gist before they ever download it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;A Day in the Life&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Own social strategy and execution across Instagram, TikTok, Threads, Substack, and emerging platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Create platform-native content, including short-form video, posts, and written pieces, in a distinct Gist voice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with agencies, individual content creators, and influencers, including our own Gist creators, to produce posts and feature them in our content.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Grow our audience and engagement through fast experimentation: test formats and hooks, study what lands, and double down.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Partner with performance marketing so social supports the broader growth funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Track and report on audience growth, engagement, and content performance to shape what we make next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Spot trends and cultural moments early, and know which ones are worth jumping on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Impact You’ll Make&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Define how Gist looks, sounds, and feels in public from launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Build an owned audience across platforms that becomes a durable growth channel for the product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Establish repeatable content playbooks and formats that scale as the team and the platform grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Bring ground-level insight on what resonates with our audience directly into product and brand decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Who You Are&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;2-3+ years of experience in social media, content, or community growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;A proven history of growing an account or channel from the ground up to a significant, engaged audience. You can show us the results and walk us through how you did it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Fluent with AI tools, with a clear point of view on how to use them to create better content faster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Strong writing, visual, and editing instincts, with a portfolio of content you made yourself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Comfortable creating across formats and platforms, from Instagram and TikTok video to Threads and Substack writing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Self-directed and fast-moving, and at home in an ambiguous, early-stage environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Experience working with or inside a larger organization while owning your channels with startup-level autonomy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Experience as a UGC creator or content creator yourself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Experience as a brand marketer at other startups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Experience writing, growing, or running a Substack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Familiarity with lifestyle feed content dynamics: what drives daily engagement, retention, and shareability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why Join This Venture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;This is more than a social role. It’s a chance to build the public identity of a new consumer product inside an industry leader.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Enjoy the autonomy of a startup, backed by AppLovin’s resources, technology, and scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;Work with a lean, fast-moving team that values creativity, speed, and good taste.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d1c1d&quot;&gt;High visibility into how brand and content drive product growth, with a direct line to leadership from day one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;AppLovin is proud to be an equal opportunity employer that is committed to inclusion and diversity. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status, or other legally protected characteristics. Learn more about EEO rights as an applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/employers/eeo-law-poster&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please send us a request at &lt;strong&gt;jobs@applovin.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;AppLovin will consider for employment all qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with applicable law.&amp;nbsp; If you’re applying for a position in California, learn more&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://calcivilrights.ca.gov/fair-chance-act/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
